# Op2_SetOscY: no oscillator block in the field (ruling 5, 2), at its first call: the a6 field named
# by the operand (a6 + {a2}) = 0, so the op skips its four words. A real state: Op2_AllocOsc
# ($005046) leaves the field 0 when ObjPool_Alloc fails on a full pool (bne to NEXT).

case no_block
w a6 + {a2} = 0
